# .trivyignore — Accepted risks for Trivy CI gate (CRA Art. 13)
#
# Each entry must have a documented justification.
# Format: <vulnerability-id> [<justification>]
#
# To add an exception:
#   1. Run 'trivy fs --severity HIGH,CRITICAL .' locally
#   2. Identify the CVE and verify it's not exploitable in our context
#   3. Add below with justification
#   4. Create a tracking issue to re-evaluate when a fix is available
